{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45370","headline":"吊灵均词 · 皎然","name":"吊灵均词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昧天道兮有无，听汨渚兮踌躇。\n期灵均兮若存，问神理兮何如。\n愿君精兮爲月，出孤影兮示予。\n天独何兮有君，君在万兮不羣。\n既冰心兮皎洁，上问天兮胡不闻。\n天不闻，神莫覩。\n若云冥冥兮雷霆怒，萧条杳眇兮余草莽。\n古山春兮爲谁，今猨哀兮何思。\n风激烈兮楚竹死，国殇人悲兮雨颸颸，雨颸颸兮望君时。\n光芒荡漾兮化爲水，万古忠贞兮徒尔爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}